SUMMARY:W03: Fartlek: 6 × (1 min hard\, 2 min easy)
DESCRIPTION:10 min easy\, then 6 × 1 minute hard (about 5K effort\, 7–8/
 10) with 2 minutes easy jogging between\, then 10 min easy. Your first pro
 per speed session.\nIf you’re not recovered\, swap it for 30 minutes eas
 y. Don’t add extra sessions to make up for a missed one.
