SUMMARY:W05: Intervals: 6 × 2 min at 5K pace
DESCRIPTION:10 min easy\, 6 × 2 minutes at 5K pace with 90 seconds easy jo
 g between\, 10 min easy. Run the first rep no faster than the last.\nIf yo
 u’re not recovered\, swap it for 30 minutes easy. Don’t add extra sess
 ions to make up for a missed one.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
