DTSTAMP:20260928T000000Z
SEQUENCE:4
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261110
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261111
SUMMARY:W07: 30 min easy + 6 × 20 sec strides
DESCRIPTION:Lighter week with a parkrun time trial on Saturday. 30 minutes 
 easy\, then 6 strides with 80 seconds walk or jog between.\nIf you’re no
 t recovered\, swap it for 30 minutes easy. Don’t add extra sessions to m
 ake up for a missed one.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
