UID:hm20270314-20261114@personal-plan.local
DTSTAMP:20260928T000000Z
SEQUENCE:4
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261114
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261115
SUMMARY:W07: parkrun time trial — race it
DESCRIPTION:Warm up with 10 minutes easy jogging before the start. Then rac
 e the 5K: start a little slower than you want for the first kilometre\, se
 ttle\, and push the last kilometre. Rough checkpoint: around 29:00. Afterw
 ards\, enter your time in Setup so your training paces update. Tomorrow’
 s long run is shorter this week; keep it easy.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
