DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261118
SUMMARY:W08: Hills: 8 × 45 sec
DESCRIPTION:10 min easy to a short\, steady hill. 8 × 45 seconds strong up
  the hill (short quick steps\, drive your arms)\, then jog or walk back do
 wn for 90 seconds. 10 min easy. Pace alerts are off for hills; go by effor
 t.\nIf you’re not recovered\, swap it for 30 minutes easy. Don’t add e
 xtra sessions to make up for a missed one.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
