SUMMARY:W22: Goal pace: 4 × 6 min at 5:41
DESCRIPTION:Peak week\, so the speed is moderate. 10 min easy\, 4 × 6 minu
 tes at race pace with 2 minutes easy between\, 5 min easy.\nIf you’re no
 t recovered\, swap it for 30 minutes easy. Don’t add extra sessions to m
 ake up for a missed one.
